{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# Character｜初始化流程图\nPawnData、ASC 和各组件何时就绪；类关系见 [[GGYGO_结构_角色与组件.canvas|结构图]]、[[Character/结构|结构文档]]。","x":0,"y":0,"width":1650,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"spawn","type":"text","text":"1. GameMode / BossEncounter 生成 Pawn，装入 PawnData。","x":0,"y":300,"width":385,"height":170,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"owner","type":"text","text":"2. Slot 或 BossState 先拥有 ASC、基础属性与授予的能力。","x":460,"y":300,"width":410,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bind","type":"text","text":"3. PawnExtension::InitializeAbilitySystem 把外部 ASC 绑定到当前 Avatar。","x":960,"y":300,"width":420,"height":190,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"init","type":"text","text":"4. InitState 推进；HealthComponent 绑定 HealthSet，移动层应用 MovementSet。","x":1460,"y":300,"width":430,"height":190,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"hero","type":"text","text":"玩家分支：HeroComponent 完成输入绑定、能力重试和相机模式委托。","x":1460,"y":650,"width":430,"height":190,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"boss","type":"text","text":"Boss 分支：AIController 驱动 BT，Pawn 不需要玩家 Hero 输入组件。","x":960,"y":680,"width":420,"height":180,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"unbind","type":"text","text":"Avatar 卸载/更换：PawnExtension 清旧绑定；宿主 ASC 生命周期继续。","x":460,"y":730,"width":410,"height":180,"color":"3"}
	],
